<section class="specialties"><p class="section-label">Areas of Focus</p><h2 class="section-heading">Where <em>clarity</em> meets<br>courageous leadership</h2><div class="cards-grid"><div class="card"><div class="card-number">01</div><h3 class="card-title">Leadership Development</h3><p class="card-desc">Build resilience and executive presence. Navigate complexity with confidence and lead with authentic impact.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="card-number">02</div><h3 class="card-title">Career Transitions</h3><p class="card-desc">Whether pivoting, re-entering, or stepping up, map your next move with strategic clarity and support.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="card-number">03</div><h3 class="card-title">Organizational Relationships</h3><p class="card-desc">Strengthen team dynamics, stakeholder relationships, and the human systems that make great workplaces.</p></div></div></section><section class="specialties alt"><p class="section-label">Situations I Support</p><h2 class="section-heading">Where people <em>reach out</em></h2><ul class="plain"><li>Stepping into a first people-leader role</li><li>Moving from technical expert to enterprise leader</li><li>Leading through an ownership change or reorganization</li><li>Switching sectors, or re-entering the workforce</li><li>Growing from HR generalist to strategic business partner</li><li>Building executive presence and stronger stakeholder relationships</li></ul></section>
